{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing your studies and working non-stop for five years, you still feel stuck in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you look for a job or pursue your dream project?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, but it's a hard one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, a notification pops up on your computer, waking you up - your friends want to meet up tonight to help you clear your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this a waste of time? Is this just a distraction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One thing is clear - you're now stuck at home, overthinking whether to go out or not today. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>7 days to think about it</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828980/extras/344a8bae5e14177111bcaa9a3d8bc9fc.poster.avif?t=1773228192\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828980/extras/344a8bae5e14177111bcaa9a3d8bc9fc.webm?t=1773228192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828980/extras/344a8bae5e14177111bcaa9a3d8bc9fc.mp4?t=1773228192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house with randomised furniture - memorise what you see and answer a &quot;Yes&quot; or &quot;No&quot; question;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric 3D aesthetic with an eerie, retro vibe;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings to discover;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unlockable extra game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><